{"id": "A03", "type": "answerable", "q": "标准版年付多少钱？", "expect": "2870 元", "must_contain": ["2870"], "source": "§1"}
{"id": "A04", "type": "answerable", "q": "免费版的存储空间多大？", "expect": "1 GB", "must_contain": ["1 GB"], "source": "§1"}
{"id": "A05", "type": "answerable", "q": "到期后数据保留多久？", "expect": "30 天", "must_contain": ["30 天"], "source": "§3"}
