{"id": "A11", "type": "answerable", "q": "支持哪些浏览器？", "expect": "Chrome、Edge、Safari 最近两个大版本", "must_contain": ["Chrome", "Edge", "Safari"], "source": "§10"}
{"id": "A12", "type": "answerable", "q": "企业版的工单响应时间是多久？", "expect": "1 小时", "must_contain": ["1 小时"], "source": "§9"}
